# Build context allowlist: only what the image build needs.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!LICENSE-UPSTREAM-MIT
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt
